---
const moments = [
  ['Before COMMIT is sent', 'No committed reservation or intent', 'No commit record for this attempt', 'No successful commit is known', 'Not called', 'If the session is lost here, its open work is rolled back. The next attempt must still recheck capacity.'],
  ['After commit, reply lost', 'Reservation + pending instruction committed', 'Commit record durably flushed in this case', 'Connection lost: outcome unknown', 'Not called', 'The database has committed, but the caller cannot infer that from its missing reply. Reconcile the same operation identity.'],
  ['After reply, worker stopped', 'Reservation + pending instruction committed', 'Commit record durably flushed', 'Successful commit received', 'Not called', 'The intended work remains recorded. A worker can resume delivery later; the payment has not happened yet.'],
  ['Provider accepts, worker loses reply', 'Reservation + pending instruction committed', 'Commit record durably flushed', 'Booking commit known; delivery uncertain', 'Charge accepted in this chosen case', 'The instruction may be delivered again. Its durable presence does not make the provider call exactly once.'],
];
---
<figure class="commit-boundary" data-commit-boundary data-moments={JSON.stringify(moments)} aria-labelledby="commit-boundary-title">
  <figcaption id="commit-boundary-title"><span>Figure 3</span> State and knowledge can part company</figcaption>
  <p class="note">Illustrative failure windows · ordinary durable commit · reservation and pending work share one transaction</p>
  <div class="path"><div><strong>Database</strong><p data-database>{moments[0][1]}</p></div><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><div><strong>Durable log</strong><p data-log>{moments[0][2]}</p></div><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><div><strong>Application knows</strong><p data-application>{moments[0][3]}</p></div><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><div class="external"><strong>Independent payment provider</strong><p data-provider>{moments[0][4]}</p></div></div>
  <label>Failure point <select data-moment>{moments.map((m,i) => <option value={i}>{m[0]}</option>)}</select></label>
  <p class="explanation" data-explanation aria-live="polite">{moments[0][5]}</p>
  <p class="note">The database’s transaction covers the reservation and instruction. The dashed provider box lies outside it. Arrows show the hand-offs being examined, not a trace from a running engine. Storage or replica loss is a separate failure contract.</p>
</figure>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-commit-boundary]').forEach((figure) => {
    const moments = JSON.parse(figure.dataset.moments || '[]');
    const select = figure.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-moment]')!;
    select.addEventListener('change', () => {
      const moment = moments[Number(select.value)];
      ['database','log','application','provider','explanation'].forEach((key,i) => {
        figure.querySelector(`[data-${key}]`)!.textContent = moment[i+1];
      });
    });
  });
</script>
<style>
  .commit-boundary{margin:2.2rem 0;padding:1.2rem;background:var(--color-surface-alt);border:1px solid var(--color-rule);font-family:var(--font-sans);}
  figcaption{font:1.2rem var(--font-serif);}figcaption span{font:.7rem var(--font-sans);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-right:.6rem;}.note{font-size:.76rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.5;}
  label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.8rem;}select{max-width:100%;font:inherit;color:var(--color-text);background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:.5rem;}.path{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;justify-items:center;margin:1rem 0;gap:.25rem;}.path>div{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:.65rem .9rem;border:1px solid var(--color-rule);}.path strong{font-size:.8rem;}.path p{font:.8rem/1.5 var(--font-mono);margin:.3rem 0 0;}.path .external{border:1px dashed var(--color-text-secondary);}.arrow{font-size:1rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);}.explanation{font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.6;min-height:4.8em;padding-top:.6rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule);}select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-text);outline-offset:3px;}
  @media(max-width:540px){.commit-boundary{padding:.8rem;}.path>div{padding:.4rem .6rem;}.path p{font-size:.72rem;}.note{font-size:.7rem;}.explanation{min-height:7em;}}
</style>
